{"metadata": {"team_id": "uva", "run_id": "disco-qrecc", "run_type": "automatic"}, "turn_id": "1-2_3", "responses": [{"rank": 1, "text": "Focusing on psychological well-being is a great step towards a healthier lifestyle. Stress management and relaxation techniques can be very effective. Consider incorporating progressive muscle relaxation or simple meditation into your daily routine to help improve your mood and reduce stress. Setting a regular schedule with a mental health professional can provide valuable support, helping you address any concerns and build a trusting relationship. It's also beneficial to engage in activities that you enjoy and that make you feel connected, as this can have a positive impact on your psychological health. Since you're a social person, try organizing activities with friends that don't revolve around screens, like going for a walk or a hike. Additionally, an internet detox might be helpful in reducing stress and improving your mental clarity. Engaging in creative activities like 3D printing can also be both therapeutic and rewarding. Combining these practices with regular physical activity will foster a balanced and healthy lifestyle.", "citations": {"clueweb22-en0014-53-14803:7": 8.044048309326172, "clueweb22-en0040-20-00729:8": 8.015377044677734, "clueweb22-en0018-35-08875:3": 7.69670295715332, "clueweb22-en0040-20-00729:9": 7.696504592895508, "clueweb22-en0016-20-17211:4": 7.604541778564453, "clueweb22-en0022-00-01144:14": 7.590290069580078, "clueweb22-en0016-31-01053:17": 7.577644348144531, "clueweb22-en0014-21-15856:5": 7.527491092681885, "clueweb22-en0029-82-09403:4": 7.504371643066406, "clueweb22-en0016-33-15722:2": 7.491514205932617}, "ptkb_provenance": ["I want to change my lifestyle."]}], "references": {"clueweb22-en0014-53-14803:7": 8.044048309326172, "clueweb22-en0040-20-00729:8": 8.015377044677734, "clueweb22-en0018-35-08875:3": 7.69670295715332, "clueweb22-en0040-20-00729:9": 7.696504592895508, "clueweb22-en0016-20-1721