{"metadata": {"team_id": "uva", "run_id": "disco-qrecc", "run_type": "automatic"}, "turn_id": "2-1_3", "responses": [{"rank": 1, "text": "To improve the taste of your coffee, ensure you're using fresh, high-quality whole coffee beans, as they retain their flavor longer compared to pre-ground coffee. If the beans aren't fresh, your coffee may taste metallic or lack aroma. Try choosing Arabica beans instead of Robusta, as they generally have a smoother, less bitter taste. Pay attention to the grind size; if the grind is too fine, it could lead to over-extraction, making your coffee taste overly bitter.  Make sure your coffee maker is cleaned regularly to prevent any residue buildup, which could affect the taste. Filter your water before brewing, as impurities can alter the flavor. Pour your coffee into ceramic mugs, glass cups, or stainless steel containers to preserve its taste.  Lastly, considering your sensitivity to acid reflux, try using alkaline water for brewing. This could help make the coffee gentler on your stomach.", "citations": {"clueweb22-en0007-86-14667:10": 11.766507148742676, "clueweb22-en0007-86-14667:9": 10.833706855773926, "clueweb22-en0007-86-14667:11": 10.697423934936523, "clueweb22-en0029-58-17697:7": 9.859057426452637, "clueweb22-en0020-87-18022:6": 9.761934280395508, "clueweb22-en0007-86-14667:12": 9.761713981628418, "clueweb22-en0025-75-03147:13": 9.718948364257812, "clueweb22-en0027-07-03529:14": 9.643857955932617, "clueweb22-en0038-48-07837:7": 9.603368759155273, "clueweb22-en0034-05-01226:17": 9.581870079040527}, "ptkb_provenance": ["I get grumpy if I don't get my coffee.", "I start my day by drinking coffee."]}], "references": {"clueweb22-en0007-86-14667:10": 11.766507148742676, "clueweb22-en0007-86-14667:9": 10.833706855773926, "clueweb22-en0007-86-14667:11": 10.697423934936523, "clueweb22-en0029-58-17697:7": 9.859057426452637, "clueweb22-en0020-87-18022:6": 9.761934280395508, "clueweb22-en0007-86-14667:12": 9.761713981628418, "clueweb22