{"metadata": {"team_id": "uva", "run_id": "disco-qrecc", "run_type": "automatic"}, "turn_id": "2-1_5", "responses": [{"rank": 1, "text": "There are several popular types of coffee, each offering unique flavors and characteristics. Arabica and Robusta are the two main species of coffee beans used worldwide. Arabica beans are known for their sweeter, softer taste and higher acidity, making them a favorite for many coffee enthusiasts. Robusta beans have a stronger, harsher flavor and contain more caffeine, often used in instant coffee or espresso blends.  In terms of coffee drinks, espresso serves as the base for many popular variants such as cappuccino, latte, and macchiato. A cappuccino consists of equal parts espresso, steamed milk, and milk foam. A latte has more steamed milk and a light layer of foam, resulting in a creamier taste. A macchiato is an espresso with a small amount of milk or foam.  There's also filter coffee, which is often milder and allows the drinker to appreciate the coffee's nuanced flavors. Cold brew, made by steeping coffee grounds in cold water for an extended period, offers a smooth, less acidic profile.  Try experimenting with different bean types, roasting levels, and brewing methods to find a coffee that suits your palate.", "citations": {"clueweb22-en0004-93-04535:1": 13.502559661865234, "clueweb22-en0011-03-12177:5": 13.031195640563965, "clueweb22-en0020-62-14086:12": 12.922855377197266, "clueweb22-en0035-00-07754:7": 12.6900634765625, "clueweb22-en0017-09-06917:4": 12.686344146728516, "clueweb22-en0017-74-02295:9": 12.631268501281738, "clueweb22-en0004-34-03315:2": 12.581825256347656, "clueweb22-en0000-64-18263:6": 12.496091842651367, "clueweb22-en0029-74-08030:13": 12.459370613098145, "clueweb22-en0000-23-14012:2": 12.444839477539062}, "ptkb_provenance": ["I am a Software Developer.", "I own a cooking machine.", "I start my day by drinking coffee."]}], "references": {"clueweb22-en0004-93-04535:1": 13.502559661865234, "clueweb22-en0011