{"metadata": {"team_id": "uva", "run_id": "disco-qrecc", "run_type": "automatic"}, "turn_id": "3-2_9", "responses": [{"rank": 1, "text": "Practicing yoga at home can be a cost-effective and convenient option, especially since you have a busy lifestyle with children and a desk job. There are plenty of free resources available online to help you get started. YouTube offers various yoga tutorials that are beginner-friendly and completely free, allowing you to practice at your own pace and schedule. Additionally, the NHS website provides exercise videos that you might find useful.  All you need to get started with yoga at home is a comfortable space, a yoga mat, and perhaps a chair if you need additional support for certain poses. This setup makes it easy to incorporate short yoga sessions into your day, which can be particularly refreshing when done in the peaceful setting of your home or garden. Practicing yoga at home also offers the flexibility to engage in mindfulness exercises, which could be beneficial for lifting your mood and improving your energy levels.   If you're interested, many apps also provide structured yoga routines, though some may feature ads. Would you like recommendations for specific videos or apps?", "citations": {"clueweb22-en0040-50-17102:13": 7.257055282592773, "clueweb22-en0040-50-17102:12": 6.846890449523926, "clueweb22-en0009-76-09135:2": 6.536365509033203, "clueweb22-en0012-15-08563:4": 6.483492851257324, "clueweb22-en0014-72-12730:7": 6.438290119171143, "clueweb22-en0039-09-11180:0": 6.366566181182861, "clueweb22-en0030-36-17863:5": 6.310535907745361, "clueweb22-en0022-19-00552:2": 6.272937297821045, "clueweb22-en0006-27-14433:10": 6.266476631164551, "clueweb22-en0019-89-15176:3": 6.229192733764648}, "ptkb_provenance": ["I work at a desk job.", "I usually listen to podcasts when I am alone home.", "I've been considering getting a standing desk.", "I am climbing regularly for the past 3 years.", "I have recently moved to a new flat with a