{"metadata": {"team_id": "uva", "run_id": "disco-qrecc", "run_type": "automatic"}, "turn_id": "3-2_10", "responses": [{"rank": 1, "text": "Yes, combining yoga and open water swimming is an excellent choice for both physical fitness and mental well-being. Yoga enhances flexibility, balance, and strength, which can complement and improve your swimming technique. It also helps with breathing control, a crucial component for effective swimming. Meanwhile, open water swimming provides a full-body workout, building endurance and cardiovascular fitness without placing undue stress on your finger injury.  Moreover, the meditative elements of yoga, alongside the calming effect of being in nature during open water swimming, can significantly reduce stress and boost your mood\u2014a perfect remedy since you've been feeling blue. Just bear in mind to ease into each activity, particularly as you recover, and pay attention to your body's signals to avoid further injury. Starting with gentle yoga and swimming sessions will help in safely integrating them into your routine.", "citations": {"clueweb22-en0038-72-16869:18": 9.738901138305664, "clueweb22-en0025-23-18696:20": 9.496136665344238, "clueweb22-en0038-72-16869:19": 9.438833236694336, "clueweb22-en0038-05-08028:17": 9.358640670776367, "clueweb22-en0006-43-04422:4": 8.996333122253418, "clueweb22-en0041-07-03986:6": 8.9793062210083, "clueweb22-en0044-60-15646:3": 8.893733978271484, "clueweb22-en0016-64-02320:1": 8.871965408325195, "clueweb22-en0041-56-07512:13": 8.728643417358398, "clueweb22-en0032-16-10129:8": 8.713529586791992}, "ptkb_provenance": ["I climb outdoors."]}], "references": {"clueweb22-en0038-72-16869:18": 9.738901138305664, "clueweb22-en0025-23-18696:20": 9.496136665344238, "clueweb22-en0038-72-16869:19": 9.438833236694336, "clueweb22-en0038-05-08028:17": 9.358640670776367, "clueweb22-en0006-43-04422:4": 8.996333122253418, "clueweb22-en0041-07-03986:6": 8.9793062210083, "clueweb22-en0044-60-15646:3": 8.89373397827