{"metadata": {"team_id": "uva", "run_id": "disco-qrecc", "run_type": "automatic"}, "turn_id": "4-2_3", "responses": [{"rank": 1, "text": "Besides the Metropolitan Museum of Art, New York City is home to a variety of other fascinating museums that you might enjoy. The American Museum of Natural History is another must-see, offering exhibits on everything from dinosaurs to the wonders of space. For modern and contemporary art, the Museum of Modern Art (MoMA) is a fantastic option with its extensive collection, including works by Van Gogh, Picasso, and Warhol.  You might also like the Solomon R. Guggenheim Museum, an architectural marvel designed by Frank Lloyd Wright, featuring a rich collection of modern art. Since you're a history teacher, a visit to the New-York Historical Society could be intriguing, as it offers a deep dive into the city's complex past. The Tenement Museum in the Lower East Side gives an insightful look at immigrant life in the late 19th to early 20th century, which could be particularly fascinating given your interest in history.  These museums provide not only cultural enrichment but also a quieter atmosphere, aligning with your preference for serene settings over crowded ones. Enjoy your time exploring New York's rich museum landscape!", "citations": {"clueweb22-en0023-84-00813:1": 11.966537475585938, "clueweb22-en0009-70-02287:0": 11.893829345703125, "clueweb22-en0010-38-01683:14": 11.840643882751465, "clueweb22-en0029-28-19159:7": 11.838081359863281, "clueweb22-en0011-59-17500:4": 11.818360328674316, "clueweb22-en0044-49-14956:0": 11.711888313293457, "clueweb22-en0024-58-06632:1": 11.684183120727539, "clueweb22-en0038-32-10586:0": 11.578720092773438, "clueweb22-en0026-78-09346:6": 11.552119255065918, "clueweb22-en0020-88-19543:6": 11.522940635681152}, "ptkb_provenance": ["I prefer quiet museums to crowded festivals."]}], "references": {"clueweb22-en0023-84-00813:1": 11.966537475585938, "clueweb22-en0009-70-02287:0": 11.893829345703125, "clue