{"metadata": {"team_id": "uva", "run_id": "disco-qrecc", "run_type": "automatic"}, "turn_id": "5-1_9", "responses": [{"rank": 1, "text": "Certainly! Beyond cauliflower rice and quinoa, there are several other nutritious and low-carb alternatives to consider. Zoodles, or zucchini noodles, are a fantastic option, offering a simple swap that is gluten-free and low in calories. You can also try spaghetti squash, which has a pasta-like texture and is low in both carbs and calories. Another idea is cabbage rice, which is not only low in carbs but also adds a crunchy texture and can be flavored easily. Shirtaki noodles, made from konjac yam, are almost calorie-free and absorb the flavors of surrounding ingredients effectively for a satisfying meal.  For something heartier, you might consider lettuce wraps, which can replace bread or tortillas for a crunchy, fresh option. If you're looking to recreate burger buns, portobello mushrooms provide a meaty texture with fewer carbs. Lastly, sweet potatoes can be roasted for a slightly higher-carb option that is high in fiber, vitamins, and antioxidants, making them thoughtful additions to diversify your lunch. Each of these options provides a nutrient-rich alternative with various flavors and textures to explore.", "citations": {"clueweb22-en0007-64-04958:5": 14.679831504821777, "clueweb22-en0004-56-06690:4": 14.479452133178711, "clueweb22-en0028-54-04669:11": 14.439905166625977, "clueweb22-en0013-81-12510:7": 14.164923667907715, "clueweb22-en0018-51-09385:1": 14.11652660369873, "clueweb22-en0013-51-14864:6": 14.062857627868652, "clueweb22-en0026-52-10967:2": 13.640228271484375, "clueweb22-en0004-56-06690:5": 13.526632308959961, "clueweb22-en0039-54-15229:20": 13.496975898742676, "clueweb22-en0003-12-08571:3": 13.47012996673584}, "ptkb_provenance": ["I prefer foods with more nutrients and protein.", "I am interested in low-carb food.", "I usually eat white rice for my lunch."]}], "references": {"clueweb22-en0007-64-04958:5": 14.67