{"metadata": {"team_id": "uva", "run_id": "disco-qrecc", "run_type": "automatic"}, "turn_id": "6-1_12", "responses": [{"rank": 1, "text": "After microneedling, it's essential to be cautious with your skincare routine to avoid irritation and support healing. Salicylic acid is a beta hydroxy acid (BHA) that's effective for managing oily skin and combating acne because it penetrates deeply into the pores. However, it can be too harsh immediately after microneedling due to the increased sensitivity of your skin. It\u2019s advisable to pause using your salicylic acid face wash and other strong acids for about 24 to 48 hours following the treatment to prevent potential irritation or inflammation. Once your skin has calmed down, you can gradually reintroduce it into your routine. As for your oily scalp and hair, you can continue managing them as usual since products for hair care generally don't affect the skin post-microneedling. Always ensure that any product that can potentially drip onto your face during use doesn\u2019t contain harsh or irritating ingredients post-treatment. In the meantime, focus on hydrating and soothing your skin with gentle products, like those containing hyaluronic acid, to promote healing.", "citations": {"clueweb22-en0032-14-18871:12": 12.873023986816406, "clueweb22-en0033-70-02855:4": 11.79410457611084, "clueweb22-en0016-51-13074:2": 11.7703218460083, "clueweb22-en0007-31-11995:8": 11.690129280090332, "clueweb22-en0033-70-02855:5": 11.577624320983887, "clueweb22-en0026-05-16537:9": 11.301187515258789, "clueweb22-en0007-31-11995:7": 11.29321575164795, "clueweb22-en0009-04-10812:12": 11.171592712402344, "clueweb22-en0038-25-10041:12": 11.099555969238281, "clueweb22-en0001-02-00582:9": 11.074402809143066}, "ptkb_provenance": ["I use AHA BHA serum once a week.", "I apply Hyaluronic Acid two times a day after washing my face."]}], "references": {"clueweb22-en0032-14-18871:12": 12.873023986816406, "clueweb22-en0033-70-02855:4": 11.79410457611084, "c