{"metadata": {"team_id": "uva", "run_id": "disco-qrecc", "run_type": "automatic"}, "turn_id": "9-2_5", "responses": [{"rank": 1, "text": "The jockey wheels are two small sprockets found in the rear derailleur of a bicycle. They guide the chain onto the cassette as you shift gears. There are two jockey wheels: the upper one is called the guide pulley, which helps direct the chain onto the correct sprocket; it often has more lateral play to assist with smooth operation, especially when the chain line isn't perfectly straight. The lower one is known as the tension pulley, and its main job is to take up slack in the chain, maintaining proper tension as you shift between different gears. These wheels are housed in a cage and are crucial for ensuring smooth and efficient gear shifting.", "citations": {"clueweb22-en0035-43-13674:3": 11.385494232177734, "clueweb22-en0019-53-15451:0": 10.895293235778809, "clueweb22-en0032-78-01787:0": 10.69494915008545, "clueweb22-en0039-65-07416:2": 10.646035194396973, "clueweb22-en0041-55-13857:3": 10.401346206665039, "clueweb22-en0004-74-03600:2": 10.290228843688965, "clueweb22-en0019-53-15451:1": 10.143442153930664, "clueweb22-en0018-20-12295:16": 10.14256477355957, "clueweb22-en0026-90-17949:3": 9.954431533813477, "clueweb22-en0040-35-09091:5": 9.901917457580566}, "ptkb_provenance": ["I'm a casual bike rider.", "I take my bike in the train and the bus.", "I like biking even in rainy weather and in the forest."]}], "references": {"clueweb22-en0035-43-13674:3": 11.385494232177734, "clueweb22-en0019-53-15451:0": 10.895293235778809, "clueweb22-en0032-78-01787:0": 10.69494915008545, "clueweb22-en0039-65-07416:2": 10.646035194396973, "clueweb22-en0041-55-13857:3": 10.401346206665039, "clueweb22-en0004-74-03600:2": 10.290228843688965, "clueweb22-en0019-53-15451:1": 10.143442153930664, "clueweb22-en0018-20-12295:16": 10.14256477355957, "clueweb22-en0026-90-17949:3": 9.954431533813477, "clueweb22-en0040-35-09091:5": 9.901917457580566, "clueweb22